Package: slopeaudit
Type: Package
Title: Diagnose Information Sources in Gaussian Random-Slope Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Tingshan",
      family = "Liu",
      email = "tliu68@jhmi.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Implements validated components of a diagnostic framework for
    person-specific rates of change in Gaussian linear mixed models. The package
    separates direct within-person information about a target random slope from
    additional model-assisted information, supports boundary-aware testing of
    random-slope heterogeneity, and evaluates prospective information under
    supplied designs. The first public interface targets scalar Gaussian random
    slopes, with an adapter for compatible 'lme4' model fits and a matrix-based
    computational backend. A public resampling contract for source stability is
    deliberately deferred.
